(158, 9, 3, NULL, 'Q-CHE-100', 'mcq', 'medium', 'A nurse studies atomic structure to better understand electrolyte balance in the body. Which property of atoms is most directly related to the formation of ions such as Na? and Cl??', NULL, NULL, 0.50, 0.00, 'Atoms gain or lose valence electrons to form ions. Understanding this helps nurses interpret electrolyte balance, fluid therapy, and nerve conduction.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-09-07 11:22:30', '2026-10-10 11:37:10', '2026-10-10 11:37:10'),
(159, 5, 4, NULL, 'QT-MATHS-001', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the solution to the quadratic equation $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'To solve the quadratic equation $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$ by factoring, we look for two numbers that multiply to $6$ and add up to $-5$. \r\n\r\nThese numbers are $-2$ and $-3$, since:\r\n- $(-2) \\times (-3) = 6$\r\n- $(-2) + (-3) = -5$\r\n\r\nRewriting the quadratic expression gives:\r\n$$(x - 2)(x - 3) = 0$$\r\n\r\nSetting each factor to zero:\r\n- $x - 2 = 0 \\implies x = 2$\r\n- $x - 3 = 0 \\implies x = 3$\r\n\r\nTherefore, the correct solution is $x = 2, x = 3$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-10 16:17:56', '2026-09-30 20:44:03', NULL),
(160, 5, 4, NULL, 'Q-MATHS-02', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Evaluate the definite integral: $\\int_{0}^{2} 3x^2 \\, dx$', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'To evaluate the definite integral $\\int_{0}^{2} 3x^2 \\, dx$, we first find the antiderivative of the integrand using the power rule for integration:\r\n$$\\int 3x^2 \\, dx = 3 \\left(\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right) = x^3$$\r\n\r\nNext, we apply the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus by evaluating the antiderivative at the upper limit ($2$) and lower limit ($0$):\r\n$$\\left[ x^3 \\right]_{0}^{2} = (2^3) - (0^3)$$\r\n\r\nCalculating the values:\r\n$$2^3 = 8$$\r\n$$0^3 = 0$$\r\n$$8 - 0 = 8$$\r\n\r\nTherefore, the value of the definite integral is $8$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-10 16:22:42', '2026-11-01 12:00:43', NULL),
(161, 5, 7, NULL, 'AG-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following is defined as the rearing of aquatic organisms under controlled conditions?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Aquaculture involves the cultivation of aquatic plants and animals such as fish', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-15 23:10:50', '2026-09-15 23:10:50', NULL),
