(224, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main nitrogenous waste excreted by mammals?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Mammals convert toxic ammonia into urea in the liver, which is safely excreted via urine by the kidneys.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(225, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-15', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which genetic law states that allele pairs separate during gamete formation?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Mendel\'s Law of Segregation dictates that paired alleles separate randomly during meiosis so each gamete receives one.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(226, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-16', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the functional filtering unit of the kidney?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Nephrons filter blood, reabsorb vital nutrients, and concentrate waste into urine.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(227, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-17', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which gas is released into the atmosphere as a byproduct of photosynthesis?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Oxygen is produced when water molecules are split during the light-dependent reactions of photosynthesis.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(228, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-18', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of macromolecule are enzymes primarily composed of?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Most enzymes are globular proteins folded into precise 3D shapes that catalyze biochemical reactions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(229, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-19', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which vitamin deficiency causes scurvy in humans?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Vitamin C (ascorbic acid) is essential for collagen synthesis; its deficiency leads to bleeding gums and scurvy.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(230, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-20', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for an organism\'s genetic makeup, as distinguished from its physical traits?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Genotype represents the exact set of alleles carried by an organism, whereas phenotype is the observable expression.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(231, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-21', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which cellular process results in the formation of four genetically distinct haploid gametes?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Meiosis involves two rounds of cell division following one round of DNA replication, producing four haploid cells.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(232, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-22', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the largest organ in the human body?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The integumentary system (skin) is the body\'s largest organ, serving protection, sensory, and regulatory functions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(233, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-23', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which type of vascular tissue transports organic nutrients (sugars) manufactured in leaves?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Phloem distributes sugars and organic compounds produced by photosynthesis throughout the plant body.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(234, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-24', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the process by which white blood cells engulf and digest foreign particles and pathogens?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Phagocytosis (\'cell eating\') is a form of endocytosis where immune cells engulf large debris or microorganisms.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(235, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-25', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which hormone regulates blood glucose levels by promoting glucose uptake into body cells?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Insulin is secreted by beta cells in the pancreas in response to high blood glucose levels.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(236, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-26', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the evolutionary process where new species arise from a common ancestor?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Speciation occurs when populations evolve to become reproductively isolated and form distinct species.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(237, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-27', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which structure in flowering plants develops into a seed after fertilization?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The ovule develops into a seed following fertilization, while the surrounding ovary matures into a fruit.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(238, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-28', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary site of lipid synthesis in eukaryotic cells?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The smooth endoplasmic reticulum lacks ribosomes and specializes in lipid and steroid hormone synthesis.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(239, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-29', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which blood vessel carries oxygenated blood from the lungs back to the heart?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Pulmonary veins are unique in carrying oxygen-rich blood from the respiratory surfaces of the lungs to the left atrium.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(240, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-30', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes all the living organisms interacting with one another and their physical environment?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An ecosystem encompasses both biotic communities and abiotic environmental factors interacting as a system.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(241, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-31', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which nitrogenous base is found in RNA but NOT in DNA?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Uracil replaces thymine in RNA molecules, pairing with adenine during transcription.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(242, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-32', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the muscular tube that connects the pharynx to the stomach?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The esophagus uses peristaltic muscular contractions to transport swallowed food down to the stomach.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(243, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-33', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which microbial domain includes extremophiles thriving in hot springs and salty lakes?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Archaea are single-celled prokaryotes known for inhabiting extreme environments like hydrothermal vents and salt flats.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(244, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-34', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the role of hemoglobin in red blood cells?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Hemoglobin is an iron-containing protein that binds reversibly to oxygen molecules for transport throughout the body.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(245, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-35', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which stage of aerobic respiration produces the greatest amount of ATP?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The electron transport chain located in the inner mitochondrial membrane yields approximately 32-34 ATP molecules.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(246, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-36', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for a permanent change in the nucleotide sequence of an organism\'s DNA?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Mutations are alterations in DNA sequences that can introduce genetic variation or cause genetic disorders.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(247, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-37', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which plant hormone promotes fruit ripening and abscission?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Ethylene is a gaseous plant hormone that accelerates fruit ripening, leaf drop, and flower fading.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(248, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-38', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary function of lysosomes within cells?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Lysosomes contain acidic hydrolytic enzymes that break down worn-out organelles, cellular debris, and engulfed pathogens.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(249, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which animal phylum includes insects, arachnids, and crustaceans?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Arthropods are characterized by jointed appendages, segmented bodies, and chitinous exoskeletons.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(250, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-40', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the pressure exerted by water inside a plant cell against its cell wall called?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Turgor pressure keeps plant tissues firm and upright, preventing wilting when water is abundant.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(251, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-41', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which human endocrine gland is often referred to as the \'master gland\'?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The pituitary gland secretes multiple hormones that regulate other endocrine glands across the body.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(252, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-42', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the study of interactions between organisms and their environment called?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Ecology examines how organisms relate to one another and their physical surroundings.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(253, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which cellular organelle is responsible for modifying, sorting, and packaging proteins for secretion?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The Golgi apparatus processes proteins received from the endoplasmic reticulum and dispatches them to destinations.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(254, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-44', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of symmetry is exhibited by adult echinoderms like starfish?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Adult echinoderms typically display secondary pentamerous radial symmetry, though their larvae are bilaterally symmetrical.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(255, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-45', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which process converts atmospheric nitrogen gas into ammonia usable by plants?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Nitrogen fixation is performed by specialized bacteria (e.g., Rhizobium, Azotobacter) to make nitrogen bioavailable.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:51:06', NULL),
(256, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-46', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main function of red bone marrow?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Red bone marrow is responsible for hematopoiesis—producing red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(257, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-47', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which blood vessels possess valves to prevent the backflow of blood?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Veins utilize one-way valves and skeletal muscle contractions to return low-pressure blood back to the heart.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(258, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-48', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for an organism that obtains its energy by consuming other living organisms?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Heterotrophs rely on organic substances produced by other organisms for nutrition, as they cannot fix carbon themselves.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(259, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-49', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which part of the flower receives pollen grains during pollination?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The sticky surface of the stigma is specifically adapted to catch and retain compatible pollen grains.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(260, 5, 6, NULL, 'BIO-50', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the double-layered membrane that encloses the heart called?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The pericardium protects the heart, anchors it in the chest cavity, and lubricates its continuous rhythmic movements.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:06:00', '2026-09-16 00:06:00', NULL),
(261, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the chemical symbol for gold?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The symbol \'Au\' for gold comes from its Latin name \'aurum\', meaning shining dawn.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(262, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which subatomic particle carries a negative electrical charge?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Electrons are subatomic particles with a negative elementary charge orbiting the nucleus.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(263, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the pH value of a neutral solution at 25°C?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'At standard temperature, a neutral solution has an equal concentration of hydronium and hydroxide ions, resulting in a pH of 7.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(264, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-04', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which gas is evolved when a dilute acid reacts with an active metal such as zinc?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Reaction of metals with acids typically produces a metal salt and hydrogen gas (e.g., Zn + 2HCl -> ZnCl2 + H2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(265, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-05', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the chemical formula for common table salt?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Sodium chloride (NaCl) is an ionic compound commonly known as table salt.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(266, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-06', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following elements is a noble gas?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Argon is a Group 18 noble gas characterized by its chemical inertness and full valence electron shell.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(267, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-07', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of chemical bond involves the sharing of electron pairs between atoms?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Covalent bonding occurs when nonmetal atoms share electrons to achieve a stable octet configuration.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(268, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the molar mass of water (H2O) approximately?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Water consists of two hydrogen atoms (~1 g/mol each) and one oxygen atom (~16 g/mol), totaling ~18 g/mol.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(269, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-09', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which law states that mass is neither created nor destroyed in a chemical reaction?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Antoine Lavoisier\'s Law of Conservation of Mass establishes that total mass of reactants equals products in closed systems.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(270, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-10', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the functional group characteristic of carboxylic acids?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Carboxylic acids contain the carboxyl functional group (-COOH), conferring acidic properties to organic molecules.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(271, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-11', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which process describes the direct conversion of a solid into a gas without passing through the liquid phase?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Sublimation occurs when substances like dry ice (solid CO2) or iodine transition directly from solid to vapor.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(272, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-12', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the most abundant gas in Earth\'s atmosphere by volume?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Nitrogen gas (N2) comprises approximately 78% of Earth\'s atmosphere by volume.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(273, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-13', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which catalyst is used in the Haber process for the industrial manufacture of ammonia?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Finely divided iron serves as the catalyst in the Haber process combining nitrogen and hydrogen gases.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(274, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What term describes solutions that resist changes in pH when small amounts of acid or base are added?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Buffer solutions consist of a weak acid and its conjugate base (or vice versa) to maintain stable pH.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(275, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-15', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is an example of an exothermic reaction?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Combustion releases heat energy to the surroundings, classifying it as an exothermic chemical reaction.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(276, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-16', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the oxidation state of sulfur in sulfuric acid (H2SO4)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'With H at +1 and O at -2, sulfur\'s oxidation number in H2SO4 is calculated as +2 + x - 8 = 0, so x = +6.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(277, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-17', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which laboratory glassware is primarily designed for accurate volumetric titration measurements?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A burette is a graduated glass tube with a stopcock used for dispensing precise volumes of liquid during titrations.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(278, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-18', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the hybridisation of carbon atoms in ethene (C2H4)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Ethene contains a carbon-carbon double bond, where each carbon atom exhibits trigonal planar geometry with sp2 hybridisation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(279, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-19', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which halogen is a liquid at room temperature and standard atmospheric pressure?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Bromine is one of the only two elemental elements on the periodic table that are liquid at room conditions (alongside mercury).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(280, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-20', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is Avogadro\'s number representing the number of particles in one mole of a substance?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Avogadro\'s constant (NA ≈ 6.022 × 10^23 mol^-1) defines the number of constituent particles in a mole.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(281, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-21', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which organic compounds contain a carbon-carbon triple bond?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Alkynes are unsaturated hydrocarbons characterized by at least one carbon-carbon triple bond (general formula CnH2n-2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(282, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the chemical term for rust formed on iron surfaces?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Rust is a complex hydrated iron(III) oxide formed by the electrochemical oxidation of iron in the presence of water and oxygen.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(283, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-23', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which law relates the volume of a gas directly to its absolute temperature at constant pressure?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Charles\'s Law states that gas volume is directly proportional to absolute temperature (V ∝ T) at constant pressure.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(284, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-24', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What color does litmus paper turn in the presence of a strong alkaline solution?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Alkalis turn red litmus paper blue, whereas acids turn blue litmus paper red.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(285, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-25', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which isotope is used as the standard for defining atomic mass units (amu)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Carbon-12 is established as the international standard where one amu is defined as 1/12 the mass of a carbon-12 atom.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(286, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-26', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the primary product of the saponification process?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Saponification involves base hydrolysis of fats or oils with sodium hydroxide to produce soap and glycerol.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(287, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which periodic trend describes the energy required to remove an electron from a gaseous atom?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'First ionization energy measures how strongly an atom holds onto its valence electrons.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(288, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-28', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of colloid is fog or mist classified as?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Fog is a liquid aerosol formed by tiny droplets of water suspended in a gas (air).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(289, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-29', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which acid is commonly known as oil of vitriol?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Sulfuric acid (H2SO4) was historically referred to as oil of vitriol due to its oily appearance and preparation from green vitriol.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(290, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-30', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the coordination number of the central metal ion in [Co(NH3)6]3+?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The cobalt ion is bonded to six monodentate ammonia ligands, giving a coordination number of 6.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(291, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following elements has the highest electronegativity?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Fluorine is the most electronegative element on the Pauling scale, with a value of approximately 3.98.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(292, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-32', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the general formula for saturated open-chain hydrocarbons (alkanes)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Alkanes are saturated acyclic hydrocarbons satisfying the general chemical formula CnH2n+2.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(293, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-33', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which gas is produced when calcium carbonate reacts with hydrochloric acid?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'CaCO3 + 2HCl -> CaCl2 + H2O + CO2(g), releasing carbon dioxide gas which turns lime water milky.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(294, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-34', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for molecules that have the same molecular formula but different structural arrangements?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Isomers share identical molecular formulas but differ in structural bonding or spatial orientation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(295, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-35', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which metal is extracted primarily from bauxite ore?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Bauxite is the principal ore of aluminum, processed industrially via the Bayer and Hall-Héroult processes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(296, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-36', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the pH range for acidic solutions at 25°C?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Acidic solutions possess hydrogen ion concentrations higher than pure water, corresponding to pH values below 7.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(297, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-37', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which law states that the total pressure of a gas mixture is the sum of partial pressures of individual gases?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Dalton\'s Law dictates that P_total = P1 + P2 + P3 + ... in ideal gas mixtures.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(298, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-38', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the chemical formula for ozone?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Ozone is an allotrope of oxygen consisting of three oxygen atoms bound together in a triatomic molecule.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(299, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which functional group is present in simple ethers?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Ethers contain an ether group consisting of an oxygen atom connected to two alkyl or aryl groups (R-O-R\').', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(300, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-40', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What term refers to the minimum energy required by reactants to initiate a chemical reaction?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Activation energy (Ea) represents the energy barrier that reactant molecules must overcome to form products.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(301, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which element is alloyed with copper to produce brass?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Brass is a substitutional alloy composed primarily of copper and zinc in varying proportions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(302, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-42', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the main component of natural gas?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Methane (CH4) typically makes up 70% to 90% of natural gas reserves worldwide.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(303, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which subatomic particle was discovered by James Chadwick in 1932?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'James Chadwick discovered the neutron, explaining atomic mass discrepancies and isotopes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(304, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-44', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of bond holds water molecules together in liquid and solid states?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Intermolecular hydrogen bonding between polar water molecules accounts for water\'s high boiling point and cohesion.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(305, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-45', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which chemical test is used to detect the presence of starch by turning a deep blue-black?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Iodine solution reacts with starch macromolecules to form a characteristic dark blue-black inclusion complex.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(306, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-46', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the oxidation number of free elements in their uncombined state?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'By definition, atoms in their elemental uncombined state are assigned an oxidation number of zero.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(307, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-47', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which organic reaction involves the addition of water across a carbon-carbon double bond?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Hydration reactions add H+ and OH- across unsaturated double bonds, typically producing alcohols.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(308, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-48', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for a substance that speeds up a chemical reaction without being consumed itself?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Catalysts provide alternative reaction pathways with lower activation energies without undergoing net change.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(309, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-49', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which group on the periodic table is known as the alkali metals?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Group 1 elements (excluding hydrogen) are reactive alkali metals forming strong alkaline hydroxides with water.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(310, 5, 8, NULL, 'CHEM-50', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the chemical formula for baking soda?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Sodium bicarbonate (NaHCO3) is commonly known as baking soda and acts as a leavening agent in baking.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:07:26', '2026-09-16 00:07:26', NULL),
(311, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'According to the account of creation in Genesis, what did God create on the first day?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'On the first day of creation, God spoke light into existence and separated light from darkness (Genesis 1:3-5).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(312, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was the mother of Samuel the prophet?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Hannah was barren for many years before God answered her fervent prayer and blessed her with Samuel (1 Samuel 1:20).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(313, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'In which river was Jesus baptized by John the Baptist?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Jesus traveled from Galilee to the River Jordan to be baptized by John (Matthew 3:13).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(314, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-04', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which prophet confronted King Ahab and the prophets of Baal on Mount Carmel?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Elijah challenged the 450 prophets of Baal to a contest on Mount Carmel to prove that Yahweh is the true God (1 Kings 18).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(315, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-05', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary theme of the Sermon on the Mount taught by Jesus in Matthew chapters 5 to 7?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The Sermon on the Mount outlines Christian ethics, character, and the spiritual requirements of entering God\'s kingdom.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(316, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-06', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was thrown into the den of lions because he continued to pray to God against the king\'s decree?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Daniel faithfully maintained his prayer habit despite the malicious decree of King Darius and was miraculously protected by an angel (Daniel 6).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(317, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-07', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which apostle denied knowing Jesus three times before the rooster crowed?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Simon Peter denied Jesus three times out of fear during Jesus\' trial, fulfilling Jesus\' earlier prediction (Luke 22:54-62).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(318, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What city was Saul of Tarsus heading to when he experienced a miraculous heavenly vision of Jesus?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Saul was on his way to Damascus to persecute Christians when the resurrected Christ appeared to him, leading to his conversion (Acts 9).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(319, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-09', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which Old Testament character was sold into slavery by his jealous brothers but later became a ruler in Egypt?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Joseph was sold by his brothers, endured hardships, and God eventually elevated him to second-in-command over Egypt to save many lives during famine.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(320, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-10', 'mcq', 'medium', 'According to Paul\'s letter to the Corinthians, which of the three virtues is considered the greatest?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'In 1 Corinthians 13:13, Paul concludes that faith, hope, and love abide, but the greatest of these is love (agape).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(321, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-11', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was chosen to replace Judas Iscariot as an apostle among the remaining disciples?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Matthias was selected through prayer and casting lots to fill the vacancy left by Judas Iscariot (Acts 1:23-26).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(322, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-12', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What miraculous sign did Jesus perform at the wedding in Cana of Galilee?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Turning water into wine at Cana was recorded by John as the first miraculous sign performed by Jesus (John 2:1-11).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(323, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-13', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who led the Israelites across the River Jordan into the Promised Land after the death of Moses?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Joshua succeeded Moses as leader and successfully led the Israelites across the Jordan River into Canaan (Joshua 3).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(324, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is traditionally known as the birthday of the Christian Church?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'On the day of Pentecost, the Holy Spirit descended upon the disciples, empowering them to preach and forming the early church (Acts 2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_questions` (`id`, `organization_id`, `subject_id`, `topic_id`, `question_code`, `question_type`, `difficulty_level`, `question`, `question_image`, `question_image_alt`, `marks`, `negative_marks`, `explanation`, `hint`, `time_limit_seconds`, `is_randomizable`, `status`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`) VALUES
(325, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-15', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which king of Judah was known for finding the Book of the Law during temple repairs and initiating sweeping religious reforms?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'King Josiah spearheaded a major religious revival across Judah after the Book of the Law was rediscovered in the temple (2 Kings 22-23).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(326, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-16', 'mcq', 'medium', 'In the parable of the Good Samaritan, who was the first person to pass by the injured traveler without helping?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Both a priest and a Levite passed by on the other side before the merciful Samaritan stopped to help (Luke 10:30-32).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(327, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-17', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was the first Christian martyr stoned to death for his faith in Jerusalem?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Stephen, one of the seven chosen deacons, was martyred by stoning while preaching fearlessly about Jesus (Acts 7).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(328, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-18', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What covenant sign did God give to Noah as a promise never again to destroy the earth by a flood?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'God placed a rainbow in the clouds as the visible sign of His covenant with Noah and all living creatures (Genesis 9:12-17).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(329, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-19', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which prophet was swallowed by a great fish when he tried to flee from God\'s mission to Nineveh?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Jonah disobeyed God\'s command to preach in Nineveh, boarded a ship, was thrown overboard, and was rescued by a great fish (Jonah 1-2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(330, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-20', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What are the first five books of the Old Testament commonly referred to as?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Pentateuch comprises Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, and Deuteronomy, attributed traditionally to Moses.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(331, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-21', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was the Roman governor who presided over the trial of Jesus and authorized His crucifixion?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Pontius Pilate judged Jesus and, under pressure from the crowd, handed Him over to be crucified (Matthew 27).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(332, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which attribute of God describes His ultimate power to create and govern all things?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Omnipotence refers to God\'s attribute of possessing unlimited power and authority over the universe.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(333, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-23', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was the wise king of Israel famous for building the first temple in Jerusalem?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'King Solomon, son of David, was granted great wisdom and constructed the magnificent temple in Jerusalem (1 Kings 6).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(334, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-24', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What did Jesus declare Himself to be in John 14:6 regarding the way to eternal life?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Jesus stated: \'I am the way, the truth, and the life. No one comes to the Father except through me\' (John 14:6).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(335, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-25', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which queen of Persia risked her life to save her Jewish people from a decree of extermination?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Queen Esther courageously approached King Xerxes uninvited to intercede for the Jewish nation (Book of Esther).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(336, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-26', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary theme emphasized in the Epistle of James regarding faith?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'James emphasizes that genuine saving faith naturally expresses itself through righteous actions and good deeds (James 2:17).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(337, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-27', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who interpreted Pharaoh\'s dreams about seven years of abundance followed by seven years of famine?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Joseph accurately interpreted Pharaoh\'s dreams, enabling Egypt to prepare grain reserves during the years of plenty (Genesis 41).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(338, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-28', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which disciple famously doubted the resurrection of Jesus until he personally touched Jesus\' wounds?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Thomas declared he would not believe unless he saw and touched the nail prints, earning the moniker \'Doubting Thomas\' (John 20:24-29).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(339, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-29', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What mountain did Moses ascend to receive the Ten Commandments from God?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Moses spent forty days on Mount Sinai receiving the stone tablets inscribed with the covenant laws (Exodus 24:12).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(340, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-30', 'mcq', 'easy', 'In Jesus\' parable of the Prodigal Son, what was the immediate reaction of the father when his lost son returned?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The father demonstrated unconditional love and forgiveness by running to hug his repentant son and hosting a grand feast (Luke 15:20-24).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(341, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was the faithful Moabite woman who chose to stay with her mother-in-law Naomi and eventually became the great-grandmother of King David?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Ruth demonstrated loyalty and faith in God, marrying Boaz and entering the lineage of Jesus Christ (Book of Ruth).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(342, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-32', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What major event in church history was addressed during the Jerusalem Council in Acts 15?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The Jerusalem Council decided that Gentile converts were saved by grace through faith without requiring Jewish circumcision and ceremonial law.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(343, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-33', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which prophet foretold that the Messiah would be born of a virgin in Bethlehem?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Micah 5:2 prophesied that a ruler of Israel would come forth from Bethlehem, fulfilled in the birth of Jesus (Matthew 2:5-6).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(344, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-34', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What did Jesus give to His disciples as a new commandment during the Last Supper?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Jesus commanded His followers: \'As I have loved you, so you must love one another\' (John 13:34).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(345, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-35', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was the oldest man recorded in the Bible, living for 969 years?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Methuselah, son of Enoch, lived to the remarkable age of 969 years (Genesis 5:27).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(346, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-36', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which New Testament book is primarily a letter written by Paul to explain justification by faith apart from the works of the law?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The Epistle to the Romans provides a comprehensive theological exposition of salvation through faith in Jesus Christ.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(347, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-37', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What was the name of the garden where Jesus prayed earnestly in agony before His crucifixion?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Jesus withdrew to the Garden of Gethsemane on the Mount of Olives to pray prior to His arrest (Matthew 26:36).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(348, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-38', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was the high priest who presided over the religious trial of Jesus before handing Him over to Pilate?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Caiaphas was the high priest that year who interrogated Jesus and played a key role in condemning Him.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(349, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which fruit of the Spirit is listed first by Apostle Paul in Galatians 5:22-23?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Paul lists the fruit of the Spirit starting with love, followed by joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, and self-control.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(350, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-40', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What did God use to speak to Moses while he was tending sheep in the desert of Midian?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'God called out to Moses from within a miraculous burning bush that burned without being destroyed (Exodus 3:2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(351, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was the wicked king of Israel whose wife Jezebel promoted the worship of Baal?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'King Ahab of northern Israel did more evil in the eyes of the Lord than all who were before him, influenced by Jezebel (1 Kings 16:30).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(352, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-42', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary lesson taught by Jesus through the parable of the Talents in Matthew 25?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The parable emphasizes faithful stewardship and accountability in utilizing the talents and opportunities entrusted by God.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(353, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Who was the Levite prophetess and judge who led Israel to victory alongside Barak against Sisera\'s army?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Deborah served as a judge of Israel and summoned Barak to lead the army against the Canaanite oppressor Jabin (Judges 4-5).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(354, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-44', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which book of the Bible contains the famous chapter on love (1 Corinthians 13)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'First Corinthians chapter 13 is universally known as the \'Love Chapter\', defining the supreme nature of Christian love.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(355, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-45', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What city did the Israelites conquer by marching around its walls once a day for six days and seven times on the seventh day?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The fortified walls of Jericho miraculously collapsed after the Israelites obeyed God\'s instructions to march and shout (Joshua 6).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(356, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-46', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Who was the prophet who succeeded Elijah and requested a double portion of Elijah\'s spirit?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Elisha witnessed Elijah being taken up in a whirlwind and received his mantle along with a double portion of his prophetic spirit (2 Kings 2).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(357, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-47', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What did Jesus say is the greatest commandment in the Law?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Jesus declared that loving God supremely is the first and greatest commandment, with the second being like it: loving your neighbor as yourself (Matthew 22:37-39).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(358, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-48', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which apostle wrote the majority of the epistles (letters) in the New Testament?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Apostle Paul authored 13 epistles (from Romans to Philemon), shaping much of early Christian doctrine.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(359, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-49', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What miraculous event occurred at midnight while Paul and Silas were imprisoned and singing hymns in Philippi?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'God shook the prison with an earthquake, breaking every prisoner\'s chains and leading to the conversion of the jailer (Acts 16:25-34).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(360, 5, 14, NULL, 'CRS-50', 'mcq', 'medium', 'According to Revelation 21, what will God ultimately do for His people in the new heaven and new earth?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Revelation 21:4 promises eternal comfort where God dwells with His people, wiping away all tears and ending death, mourning, and pain.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:08:47', '2026-09-16 00:08:47', NULL),
(361, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following best defines Commerce?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Commerce encompasses trade and all auxiliaries to trade (such as banking, transport, warehousing) that facilitate the distribution of goods from producers to consumers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(362, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the primary function of retail trade in distribution?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Retailers act as the final link in the chain of distribution, selling goods directly to ultimate consumers in small quantities.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(363, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which auxiliary to trade helps bridge the gap between production and consumption by storing goods until needed?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Warehousing overcomes the time gap between production and consumption by preserving goods in optimal condition until demand arises.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(364, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-04', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of utility is created by transportation in commerce?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Transportation creates place utility by moving goods from areas of surplus production to areas where they are demanded.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(365, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-05', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which form of business organization has a separate legal entity distinct from its owners with perpetual succession?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A limited liability company is incorporated as a legal person separate from its shareholders, granting it perpetual existence regardless of changes in ownership.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(366, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-06', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What document is issued by a shipping company acknowledging receipt of goods on board and serving as a title of document?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A bill of lading is a contract of carriage between the shipper and carrier and acts as a document of title to the goods.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(367, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-07', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which economic system relies heavily on free market forces of demand and supply with minimal government intervention?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'In a capitalist (free market) economy, private individuals own factors of production, and prices are determined by market forces.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(368, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main objective of a consumer cooperative society?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Consumer cooperatives are formed by consumers to pool resources, buy in bulk, and protect themselves against exploitation by middlemen.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(369, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-09', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which financial institution is owned and controlled by the government and acts as a lender of last resort to commercial banks?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The central bank regulates the monetary system and acts as banker\'s bank and lender of last resort to commercial banks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(370, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-10', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes the excess of total revenue over total cost in business operations?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Profit is the financial gain realized when total revenue generated from sales exceeds total expenses incurred.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(371, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-11', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which method of advertising is aimed at promoting a specific brand or product name to persuade buyers?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Competitive advertising seeks to persuade consumers to choose a particular brand over competing alternatives.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(372, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-12', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is \'entrepreneurship\' primarily concerned with in commerce?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An entrepreneur coordinates land, labor, and capital, innovating and bearing the financial risks of enterprise.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(373, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-13', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which document contains the internal rules and regulations governing the management of a limited liability company?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Articles of Association outline internal bylaws, duties of directors, voting rights, and procedures for company meetings.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(374, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of warehouse is operated by customs authorities for storing imported goods until duties are paid?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Bonded warehouses hold imported goods securely until customs duties and tariffs are fully settled by the importer.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(375, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-15', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which insurance principle states that the insured must suffer a financial loss to be eligible to take out an insurance policy?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Insurable interest dictates that a policyholder must have a legal or financial stake in the subject matter insured.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(376, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-16', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for trade conducted within the geographical boundaries of a single country?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Home trade (domestic trade) involves buying and selling goods and services within national borders using local currency.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(377, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-17', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which marketing mix element refers to the channels and methods used to make products available to target customers?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, '\'Place\' in the 4Ps of marketing covers logistics, warehousing, transportation, and distribution channels.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(378, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-18', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary function of a stock exchange market?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A stock exchange facilitates liquidity by allowing investors to buy and sell quoted company shares and bonds.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(379, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-19', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which business combination involves firms engaged in different stages of production joining together?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Vertical integration occurs when a firm merges with suppliers (backward) or distributors (forward) in the supply chain.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(380, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-20', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What document is sent by a seller to a buyer detailing the description, quantity, and price of goods purchased?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An invoice serves as a formal bill demanding payment for goods delivered or services rendered.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(381, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-21', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which type of partner has unlimited liability and actively participates in the management of the firm?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'General partners take active part in daily business operations and bear unlimited liability for partnership debts.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(382, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-22', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the principal advantage of division of labor and specialization?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Specialization allows workers to master specific tasks, saving time, boosting productivity, and raising output quality.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(383, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-23', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which term describes a tax levied on goods imported into a country from abroad?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Customs duties are taxes imposed by governments on international imports to protect domestic industries and generate revenue.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(384, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-24', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the main purpose of branding a product?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Branding gives a product a unique identity, trademark protection, and helps consumers recognize quality.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(385, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-25', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which financial document shows the net profit or loss of a business over a specific accounting period?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The Income Statement (Trading, Profit and Loss Account) summarizes revenues earned and expenses incurred over a trading period.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(386, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-26', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of banking service allows customers to withdraw cash electronically via ATMs at any time?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Retail banking provides convenient electronic channels like ATMs, mobile apps, and debit cards for individual account holders.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(387, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which economic term refers to the total monetary value of all finished goods and services produced within a country in a year?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'GDP measures the overall economic output and performance of a national economy within a specified period.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(388, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-28', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary role of advertising agencies?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Advertising agencies specialize in creating effective marketing strategies and media placements for businesses.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(389, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-29', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which legal document invites the public to subscribe to shares or debentures of a newly formed public company?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A prospectus is a formal statutory document inviting public investment in shares or debentures of a public limited company.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(390, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-30', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What term describes the process of dividing a broad target market into smaller, manageable subsets of consumers?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Market segmentation groups consumers with shared characteristics to tailor marketing strategies effectively.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(391, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is a direct tax levied on the income of individuals and corporate bodies?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Direct taxes like income tax are borne directly by the taxpayer and cannot be easily shifted to others.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(392, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-32', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the function of a debit note in commercial transactions?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A debit note acts as a supplementary invoice issued to correct an undercharge or bill for extra goods sent.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(393, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-33', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which type of utility does wholesaling primarily help create by breaking bulk?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Wholesalers buy in massive bulk from manufacturers and break them down into manageable quantities for retailers, aiding distribution.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(394, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-34', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the primary distinction between private and public limited companies?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Private companies restrict share transfers and cannot invite the public to buy shares, unlike public limited companies.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(395, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-35', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which term refers to the ability of a business asset to be quickly converted into cash without loss of value?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Liquidity measures how readily assets (such as inventory or accounts receivable) can be turned into cash to meet obligations.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(396, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-36', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main purpose of trade associations in commerce?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Trade associations unite businesses in the same trade to lobby, set ethical standards, and promote mutual interests.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(397, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-37', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which shipping document details the goods loaded onto a ship and serves as a receipt issued by the ship\'s master?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A mate\'s receipt is given by the first mate to the shipper upon loading cargo, later exchanged for the bill of lading.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(398, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-38', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What type of economic integration involves the complete removal of tariffs among member nations and a common external tariff against non-members?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A customs union establishes internal free trade coupled with a unified common external tariff on non-member countries.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(399, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which channel of distribution is shortest and most direct for perishable consumer goods?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Direct selling (Producer to Consumer) eliminates middlemen entirely, ideal for perishable goods or direct services.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(400, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-40', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary role of a commercial bank in international trade?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Commercial banks facilitate global trade by issuing letters of credit, handling bills of exchange, and converting currencies.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(401, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which insurance principle ensures that the insured is restored to the exact financial position enjoyed before the loss occurred?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The principle of indemnity ensures policyholders do not profit from a loss, getting compensated only for actual financial damage.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(402, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-42', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What term describes the total value of visible exports minus visible imports over a period?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Balance of trade measures the net difference between a country\'s exported and imported physical goods.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(403, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-43', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which type of business organization is owned by members who patronize its services and share surplus based on patronage?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Cooperative societies operate on democratic principles where surplus is distributed according to member patronage.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(404, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-44', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main purpose of a credit note issued by a seller?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A credit note reduces the amount owed by a buyer due to returned goods, damaged items, or overbilling.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(405, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-45', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which economic sector encompasses manufacturing and construction industries transforming raw materials?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The secondary sector involves manufacturing, processing raw materials into finished or semi-finished goods, and construction.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(406, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-46', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the primary function of advertising media such as television and newspapers?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Advertising media serve as communication channels to convey persuasive commercial messages to target audiences.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(407, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-47', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which document is required by companies desiring to raise capital by selling shares on the stock exchange?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A prospectus provides investors with detailed financial and operational data before purchasing company securities.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(408, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-48', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of unemployment occurs when workers lose jobs due to seasonal changes in demand or production cycles?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Seasonal unemployment occurs in industries like agriculture, tourism, or construction during off-peak periods.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(409, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-49', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which financial institution specializes in providing medium-to-long-term capital for industrial and infrastructural development?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Development banks provide long-term loans, equity capital, and advisory services to foster industrial growth.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:52:17', NULL),
(410, 5, 20, NULL, 'COM-50', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary economic advantage of international trade between nations?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'International trade allows countries to specialize in producing goods where they hold comparative advantage, boosting global welfare.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:10:35', '2026-09-16 00:10:35', NULL),
(411, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following is considered the primary brain of the computer system?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The CPU (Central Processing Unit) executes instructions, performs calculations, and coordinates all computer operations.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(412, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the acronym RAM stand for in computer architecture?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'RAM stands for Random Access Memory, a volatile type of computer memory that temporarily stores data currently in use.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(413, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following is an example of system software?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An operating system like Linux is system software that manages hardware resources and provides common services for computer programs.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(414, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-04', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of device is a computer keyboard classified as?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A keyboard allows users to input text, commands, and data into a computer system, making it an input device.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(415, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-05', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which storage medium uses laser technology to read and write data optically?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Optical discs such as CDs, DVDs, and Blu-rays use laser beams to burn and read data pits on reflective surfaces.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(416, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-06', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the smallest unit of data in a computer system?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A bit (binary digit) is the fundamental unit of information in computing, representing either a 0 or a 1.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(417, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-07', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which network topology connects all devices to a central hub or switch?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'In a star topology, every node is connected directly to a central network hub or switch, ensuring fault isolation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(418, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What protocol is primarily used for securely transmitting web pages over the internet?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure) encrypts web traffic using SSL/TLS protocols to ensure secure communication.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(419, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-09', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following programming languages is classified as a low-level language?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Machine language consists of binary code directly understandable by the CPU, making it a low-level programming language.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(420, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-10', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term refers to malicious software designed to replicate and spread across computers by infecting files?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A computer virus is self-replicating malware that attaches itself to clean files and spreads through user actions or network shares.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(421, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-11', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which component of the CPU performs arithmetic and logical operations?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The ALU (Arithmetic Logic Unit) executes mathematical calculations (addition, subtraction) and logical comparisons (AND, OR).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(422, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-12', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main function of a database management system (DBMS)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A DBMS provides an efficient interface for users and applications to create, query, update, and manage databases.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(423, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-13', 'mcq', 'easy', 'How many bits are contained in a standard single byte?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A byte is universally defined as a group of 8 binary bits, capable of representing 256 different values.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(424, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which internet device forwards data packets between different computer networks?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A router examines destination IP addresses in data packets and directs them across interconnected networks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(425, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-15', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of software is distributed freely with permission for anyone to use, modify, and distribute?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Open-source software grants users access to the underlying source code for collaborative modification and distribution.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(426, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-16', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which HTML tag is used to create a hyperlink on a web page?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The anchor tag `<a>` combined with the `href` attribute is used in HTML to define hyperlinks pointing to web resources.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(427, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-17', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does \'URL\' stand for in web technology?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A URL specifies the address of a resource on the internet and the protocol used to access it.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(428, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-18', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which data structure operates on a Last-In, First-Out (LIFO) basis?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A stack data structure processes elements such that the last item added is the first one removed (push and pop operations).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(429, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-19', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary purpose of a computer firewall?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A firewall acts as a security barrier controlling network traffic to prevent unauthorized access and cyber attacks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(430, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-20', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which generation of computers introduced the use of microprocessors?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The fourth generation of computing (1971-present) is defined by the invention and integration of VLSI microprocessors.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(431, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-21', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary function of an operating system compiler?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A compiler translates human-readable source code written in languages like C++ or Java into native machine code.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(432, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-22', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following is a non-volatile memory type that retains data even when power is turned off?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'ROM is non-volatile memory storing permanent firmware instructions like BIOS needed during computer boot-up.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(433, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-23', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the binary equivalent of the decimal number 5?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Decimal 5 in binary is calculated as 4 (1) + 2 (0) + 1 (1), resulting in binary 101.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(434, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-24', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which spreadsheet formula is used to calculate the arithmetic mean of a range of cells in Excel?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The `=AVERAGE()` function sums specified numeric cell values and divides by the count to find the mean.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(435, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-25', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes unauthorized access to computer systems with malicious intent?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Malicious hacking involves bypassing security controls to exploit computer systems or steal sensitive data.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(436, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-26', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which communication medium transmits data as pulses of light through glass fibers?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Fiber optic cables transmit data via total internal reflection of light pulses, offering high bandwidth and speed.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(437, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the main purpose of primary cache memory located inside or near the CPU?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Cache memory bridges the speed gap between high-speed CPU registers and slower system RAM.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(438, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-28', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which software testing method evaluates the internal logic and structure of code?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'White-box testing examines internal code paths, control flows, and data structures implemented by programmers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-10-31 08:58:28', '2026-10-31 08:58:28'),
(439, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-29', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does \'IP\' stand for in computer networking protocol standards?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'IP (Internet Protocol) governs the routing and addressing of packets across interconnected networks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(440, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-30', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which device converts digital computer signals into analog signals for transmission over telephone lines?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A modem (Modulator-Demodulator) modulates digital signals to analog for lines and demodulates incoming analog signals.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(441, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-31', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is an algorithm defined as in computer science?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An algorithm is a finite sequence of well-defined instructions designed to solve a specific computational problem.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(442, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-32', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which SQL command is used to retrieve data from a database table?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The SQL `SELECT` statement queries and retrieves records from one or more database tables based on specified conditions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(443, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-33', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of malware demands financial ransom in exchange for decrypting locked user files?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Ransomware encrypts victim data and demands ransom payment from users to restore file access.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(444, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-34', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which component is responsible for supplying stable DC power to all internal computer parts?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The PSU converts AC mains electricity into low-voltage DC power required by motherboard components and drives.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(445, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-35', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the primary function of an assembler in programming?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'An assembler translates low-level assembly language mnemonic code directly into binary machine instructions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(446, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-36', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which data structure operates on a First-In, First-Out (FIFO) principle?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A queue data structure processes elements sequentially such that the first item added is the first one removed (enqueue/dequeue).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(447, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-37', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the term for a software bug that causes a program to crash due to recursive function calls exhausting memory?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A stack overflow occurs when call stack memory is exceeded, frequently triggered by infinite recursive calls.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(448, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-38', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which type of computer network covers a broad geographic area, such as across countries or continents?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A WAN (Wide Area Network) connects computers across large distances, with the internet being the prime example.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(449, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary role of a domain name system (DNS) server?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'DNS translates web addresses (e.g., example.com) into corresponding server IP addresses (e.g., 192.0.2.1).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(450, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-40', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which programming paradigm treats computation as the evaluation of mathematical functions and avoids mutable state?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Functional programming emphasizes immutability, pure functions, and the avoidance of shared state and side effects.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(451, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What does \'BIOS\' stand for in personal computer systems?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'BIOS is firmware stored on a ROM chip that initializes hardware during booting before loading the OS.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-10-31 08:57:53', '2026-10-31 08:57:53'),
(452, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-42', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which graphic file format supports lossless compression and transparency in web design?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'PNG (Portable Network Graphics) offers lossless data compression and alpha channel transparency support.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(453, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-43', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the term for a software vulnerability discovered and exploited before developers can patch it?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A zero-day exploit targets software security flaws unknown to the vendor, leaving zero days for defense preparation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(454, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-44', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which computer port is universally used for connecting mice, keyboards, and flash drives today?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'USB (Universal Serial Bus) is the standard industry interface for connecting peripheral devices and data transfer.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(455, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-45', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the main objective of database normalization?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Normalization organizes database tables into structured normal forms to minimize duplication and maintain integrity.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(456, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-46', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which protocol is used for sending outgoing emails across the internet?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'SMTP (Simple Mail Transfer Protocol) handles the transmission of electronic mail messages between mail servers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:52:53', NULL),
(457, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-47', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of software license restricts users from viewing or modifying the source code?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Proprietary software grants restricted usage rights while keeping source code confidential and protected.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(458, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-48', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which computer security attack floods a server with excessive traffic to crash or disrupt service?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'A Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attack overwhelms target servers with botnet traffic to render them offline.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL),
(459, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-49', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the function of a multiplexer in digital electronics?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A multiplexer (MUX) acts as a data selector routing multiple input lines through a single shared output line.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-09-16 00:11:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_questions` (`id`, `organization_id`, `subject_id`, `topic_id`, `question_code`, `question_type`, `difficulty_level`, `question`, `question_image`, `question_image_alt`, `marks`, `negative_marks`, `explanation`, `hint`, `time_limit_seconds`, `is_randomizable`, `status`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`) VALUES
(460, 5, 2, NULL, 'CS-50', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes the physical tangible components of a computer system?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Hardware refers to all physical, tangible mechanical and electronic devices comprising a computer system.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:11:48', '2026-10-31 08:57:25', '2026-10-31 08:57:25'),
(461, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which of the following is defined as the fundamental economic problem facing all societies?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Scarcity arises because human wants are unlimited while economic resources available to satisfy them are finite.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(462, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does \'opportunity cost\' represent in economic decision-making?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Opportunity cost measures what must be given up in order to obtain something else when resources are limited.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(463, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-03', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which economic system relies primarily on custom, tradition, and habit to answer basic economic questions?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Traditional economies base economic roles and production methods on inherited customs and ancestral practices.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(464, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-04', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What shape does a standard demand curve typically exhibit when plotted on a price-quantity graph?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The law of demand dictates an inverse relationship between price and quantity demanded, yielding a downward-sloping curve.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(465, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-05', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary determinant of a shift in market supply, as opposed to a movement along the supply curve?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Non-price determinants such as input costs, taxes, or technology shift the entire supply curve, whereas price changes cause movements along it.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(466, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-06', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes a market structure dominated by a single seller with high barriers to entry?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A monopoly exists when one firm is the sole supplier of a product lacking close substitutes in the market.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(467, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-07', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which macroeconomic indicator measures the total monetary value of all final goods and services produced within a country\'s borders in a given year?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'GDP measures domestic economic output regardless of the nationality of the producers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(468, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of inflation is characterized by a rapid, uncontrollable, and extreme surge in price levels?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Hyperinflation involves monthly inflation rates exceeding 50%, severely disrupting monetary stability and transactions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(469, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-09', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which macroeconomic policy tool involves government manipulation of taxation and public expenditure to influence economic activity?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Fiscal policy is managed by the government through the state budget, taxes, and public spending.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(470, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-10', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What does a price elasticity of demand (PED) greater than 1 indicate?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Elastic demand means that the percentage change in quantity demanded exceeds the percentage change in price (|PED| > 1).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(471, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-11', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which economic institution acts as the supreme monetary authority and banker to commercial banks in a country?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The central bank oversees monetary policy, currency issuance, and regulates commercial banking institutions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(472, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-12', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What term describes the additional satisfaction or utility a consumer derives from consuming one more unit of a good?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Marginal utility measures the incremental change in total satisfaction resulting from consuming an extra unit.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(473, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-13', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which type of unemployment is caused by economic recessions and deficient aggregate demand?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Cyclical unemployment rises during economic downturns when overall demand for goods and services drops.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(474, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary characteristic of an oligopoly market structure?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Oligopoly features a small number of rival firms where each firm\'s decisions significantly impact competitors.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(475, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-15', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which curve illustrates the inverse relationship between inflation and unemployment in the short run?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The Phillips curve demonstrates an empirical trade-off showing higher inflation associated with lower unemployment in the short run.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(476, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-16', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the term for a tax where the proportion of income paid as tax increases as income rises?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Progressive taxation imposes higher tax rates on higher-income earners to redistribute wealth.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(477, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-17', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which economic concept explains why individuals specialize in tasks where they have the lowest opportunity cost?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'David Ricardo\'s theory of comparative advantage shows nations benefit from trade by specializing in goods with lower opportunity costs.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(478, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-18', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What does a Lorenz curve graphically represent in economics?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The Lorenz curve plots cumulative share of income against cumulative share of the population, used to derive the Gini coefficient.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(479, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-19', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which type of economic cost includes explicit monetary outlays as well as implicit costs of forgone alternatives?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Economic costs encompass both explicit monetary payments and implicit opportunity costs of self-owned resources.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(480, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-20', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What happens to equilibrium price and quantity when demand increases while supply remains constant?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'An outward shift in demand creates a shortage at the old price, driving both equilibrium price and quantity upward.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(481, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-21', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which monetary policy tool involves the central bank buying or selling government securities in the open market?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Open market operations directly regulate money supply by trading government bonds with commercial banks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(482, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What does \'diminishing marginal returns\' state in production theory?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'As variable inputs are added to fixed capital, marginal product eventually declines due to crowding and fixed capacity.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(483, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-23', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which term describes a situation where a country\'s exports exceed its imports in value?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A trade surplus represents favorable net exports where export value surpasses import value.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(484, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-24', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary objective of imposing import quotas by a government?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Import quotas set legal limits on foreign goods entering a market to shield domestic producers from foreign competition.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(485, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-25', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which curve shows the various combinations of two goods that can be produced efficiently with given resources and technology?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The PPC illustrates trade-offs, opportunity costs, and efficient production limits in an economy.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(486, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-26', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for the total spending by households, businesses, government, and net exporters in an economy?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Aggregate demand (AD = C + I + G + NX) represents total economy-wide expenditure at various price levels.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(487, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which market failure occurs when the production or consumption of a good imposes unintended costs on third parties?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Negative externalities (e.g., pollution) impose external social costs not reflected in private market prices.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(488, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-28', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the Consumer Price Index (CPI) primarily measure?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The CPI tracks cost-of-living changes and retail inflation experienced by typical urban households.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(489, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-29', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which type of elasticity measures the responsiveness of quantity demanded to a change in consumer income?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Income elasticity classifies goods as normal (positive) or inferior (negative) based on consumer income shifts.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(490, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-30', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What economic term describes a period of simultaneous economic stagnation (high unemployment) and high inflation?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Stagflation challenges conventional macroeconomic theory by combining stagnant output with rising price levels.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(491, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is considered a public good characterized by non-excludability and non-rivalry?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'National defense is non-rival and non-excludable, making private markets prone to the free-rider problem.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(492, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-32', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the formula for calculating marginal cost (MC)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Marginal cost measures the additional cost incurred by producing one more unit of output.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(493, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-33', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which economic school of thought, pioneered by John Maynard Keynes, advocates for active government intervention during recessions?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Keynesian economics emphasizes government fiscal stimulus and public spending to lift economies out of unemployment traps.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(494, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-34', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for a market with many buyers and sellers trading identical products with free entry and exit?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Perfect competition represents an idealized market structure where firms are price takers with zero market power.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(495, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-35', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which indicator measures the percentage of the total labor force that is jobless and actively seeking work?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The unemployment rate is calculated as unemployed workers divided by the total active labor force.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(496, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-36', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What does an upward-sloping long-run aggregate supply (LRAS) curve in some modern macroeconomic models represent?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'While classical LRAS is vertical at potential GDP, modern models or Keynesian frameworks depict upward sloping or dynamic adjustments.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(497, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-37', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which economic term describes goods that are used in the production of other goods rather than for final consumption?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Capital goods such as machinery, tools, and factories are utilized to produce future consumer goods and services.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(498, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-38', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the primary function of commercial banks in an economy?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Commercial financial intermediaries mobilize savings and channel them into productive business investments.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(499, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-39', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which type of efficiency occurs when production reflects consumer preferences, so price equals marginal cost?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Allocative efficiency is achieved when society produces the optimal mix of goods where marginal benefit equals marginal cost.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(500, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-40', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What happens to the value of money during periods of sustained inflation?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Inflation erodes the purchasing power of money, meaning each unit buys fewer goods and services over time.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(501, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is a leakage from the circular flow of income in a closed economy?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Savings represent a withdrawal (leakage) from the income-expenditure stream that is not immediately spent on domestic consumption.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(502, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-42', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What does a cross elasticity of demand greater than zero indicate about two goods?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Positive cross-price elasticity means an increase in the price of one good raises demand for the other, identifying them as substitutes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(503, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which term refers to legal restrictions set by governments on the maximum price that can be charged for a good?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Price ceilings set legal maximum prices (e.g., rent controls) intended to protect consumers, often creating shortages.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(504, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-44', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the primary economic goal of monetary policy implemented by a central bank?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Central banks primarily target low stable inflation and macroeconomic stability through monetary instruments.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(505, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-45', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which cost category does not change with the level of output produced in the short run?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Fixed costs (such as rent or loan interest) remain constant regardless of whether production output is zero or maximum.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, 2, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:47:34', NULL),
(506, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-46', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the term \'per capita income\' measure?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Per capita GDP/income divides total national income by total population size to gauge average living standards.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(507, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-47', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which market structure is characterized by many firms selling differentiated products with low barriers to entry?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Monopolistic competition features product differentiation, branding, and freedom of entry among numerous small competitors.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(508, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-48', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary economic effect of an expansionary fiscal policy?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Expansionary fiscal policy increases government spending or cuts taxes to boost aggregate demand during recessions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(509, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-49', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which economic concept explains why a consumer\'s willingness to pay for additional units of a good eventually declines?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Diminishing marginal utility states that as consumption increases, satisfaction gained from each extra unit drops.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(510, 5, 17, NULL, 'ECON-50', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the fundamental purpose of economic models in analyzing real-world behavior?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Economic models use simplifying assumptions to isolate key variables and analyze cause-and-effect relationships.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:12:42', '2026-09-16 00:12:42', NULL),
(511, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the sum of the roots of the quadratic equation $2x^2 - 5x + 3 = 0$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'For a quadratic equation $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$, the sum of roots is given by $-b/a$. Here, $-(-5)/2 = 5/2 = 2.5$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(512, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the modulus of the complex number $z = 3 - 4i$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The modulus of $z = a + bi$ is given by $|z| = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}$. Here, $\\sqrt{3^2 + (-4)^2} = \\sqrt{9 + 16} = \\sqrt{25} = 5$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(513, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-03', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the derivative of $f(x) = e^{3x} \\sin(2x)$ with respect to $x$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Using the product rule $(uv)\' = u\'v + uv\'$, where $u = e^{3x}$ and $v = \\sin(2x)$, we get $3e^{3x}\\sin(2x) + e^{3x}(2\\cos(2x))$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(514, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-04', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the value of the determinant of the $2 \\times 2$ matrix $\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\\\ \\end{pmatrix}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The determinant of $\\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{pmatrix}$ is $ad - bc$. Thus, $(4)(3) - (2)(1) = 12 - 2 = 10$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(515, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-05', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Evaluate the definite integral $\\int_{0}^{1} 3x^2 dx$.', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The antiderivative of $3x^2$ is $x^3$. Evaluating from 0 to 1 gives $(1)^3 - (0)^3 = 1 - 0 = 1$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(516, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-06', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the conjugate of the complex number $z = -2 + 5i$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The conjugate of $z = a + bi$ is $\\bar{z} = a - bi$. Thus, the conjugate of $-2 + 5i$ is $-2 - 5i$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(517, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-07', 'mcq', 'easy', 'If vector $\\mathbf{a} = 2\\mathbf{i} - 3\\mathbf{j}$ and vector $\\mathbf{b} = \\mathbf{i} + 4\\mathbf{j}$, what is their dot product $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The dot product is $(2)(1) + (-3)(4) = 2 - 12 = -10$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(518, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-08', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the nth term of an Arithmetic Progression (AP) with first term $a$ and common difference $d$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The standard formula for the nth term of an AP is $T_n = a + (n-1)d$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(519, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-09', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the gradient of the curve $y = 4x^3 - 2x + 1$ at $x = 1$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The derivative is $dy/dx = 12x^2 - 2$. Substituting $x = 1$ gives $12(1)^2 - 2 = 12 - 2 = 10$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(520, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-10', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the binomial expansion of $(1 + x)^3$ up to the term in $x^3$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Using Pascal\'s triangle or binomial theorem: $\\binom{3}{0}1^3 + \\binom{3}{1}1^2x + \\binom{3}{2}1x^2 + \\binom{3}{3}x^3 = 1 + 3x + 3x^2 + x^3$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(521, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-11', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Solve for $x$ in the logarithmic equation $\\log_2(x) + \\log_2(4) = 3$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Using log rules, $\\log_2(4x) = 3$, which means $4x = 2^3 = 8$, so $x = 2$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(522, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-12', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v} = 3\\mathbf{i} - 4\\mathbf{j} + 12\\mathbf{k}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Magnitude is $\\sqrt{3^2 + (-4)^2 + 12^2} = \\sqrt{9 + 16 + 144} = \\sqrt{169} = 13$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(523, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-13', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the sum to infinity of a geometric progression with first term $a = 6$ and common ratio $r = 1/3$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The sum to infinity is $S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r} = \\frac{6}{1 - 1/3} = \\frac{6}{2/3} = 9$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(524, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-14', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the second derivative of $y = 5x^4 - 3x^2$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'First derivative: $dy/dx = 20x^3 - 6x$. Second derivative: $d^2y/dx^2 = 60x^2 - 6$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(525, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-15', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the argument of the complex number $z = 1 + i$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The argument $\\theta = \\arctan(1/1) = \\arctan(1) = \\pi/4$ radians (45 degrees).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(526, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-16', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the inverse of the $2 \\times 2$ matrix $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 \\\\ \\end{pmatrix}$?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Determinant is $(1)(4)-(2)(3) = -2$. Inverse is $-\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} -2 & 1 \\\\ 1.5 & -0.5 \\end{pmatrix}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(527, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-17', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Evaluate $\\int x e^x dx$ using integration by parts.', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Using $\\int u dv = uv - \\int v du$ with $u=x, dv=e^x dx$, we get $x e^x - \\int e^x dx = x e^x - e^x + C = e^x(x-1)+C$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(528, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-18', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the center of the circle given by the equation $(x - 3)^2 + (y + 4)^2 = 25$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Standard circle equation is $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$ with center $(h,k)$. Thus, center is $(3, -4)$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(529, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-19', 'mcq', 'medium', 'If $y = \\ln(2x)$, what is $dy/dx$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Using chain rule: $dy/dx = \\frac{1}{2x} \\cdot 2 = \\frac{1}{x}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(530, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-20', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What are the roots of the characteristic equation for a linear differential equation with repeated roots?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'When the discriminant of the auxiliary quadratic equation is zero, the roots are real and equal.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(531, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-21', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the cross product $\\mathbf{i} \\times \\mathbf{j}$ of standard unit vectors.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Following right-hand rule for unit vectors: $\\mathbf{i} \\times \\mathbf{j} = \\mathbf{k}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(532, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the value of $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin(3x)}{x}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Using standard limit $\\lim_{\\theta \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin(k\\theta)}{\\theta} = k$, here the limit evaluates to 3.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(533, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-23', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the eccentricity $e$ of an ellipse with standard equation $\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$ (where $a > b$)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Eccentricity for a horizontal ellipse is $e = \\sqrt{1 - b^2/a^2}$ where $b^2 = a^2(1 - e^2)$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(534, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-24', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Solve the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} = 2xy$.', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Separating variables: $\\frac{1}{y}dy = 2x dx \\implies \\ln|y| = x^2 + C_1 \\implies y = Ce^{x^2}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(535, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-25', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the sum of the angles in a polygon with $n$ sides?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The sum of interior angles of any $n$-sided polygon is given by $(n-2) \\times 180^\\circ$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(536, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-26', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is De Moivre\'s Theorem used for?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'De Moivre\'s Theorem states $(\\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta)^n = \\cos(n\\theta) + i\\sin(n\\theta)$, used for complex powers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(537, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the area bounded by the curve $y = x^2$, the x-axis, and lines $x = 0$ and $x = 3$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Area is $\\int_{0}^{3} x^2 dx = \\left[ \\frac{x^3}{3} \\right]_0^3 = \\frac{27}{3} - 0 = 9$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(538, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-28', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for a matrix where the number of rows equals the number of columns?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A matrix with an equal number of rows and columns ($n \\times n$) is defined as a square matrix.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(539, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-29', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the derivative of $\\cos(x)$ with respect to $x$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The standard derivative of $\\cos(x)$ with respect to $x$ is $-\\sin(x)$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(540, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-30', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the symbol $\\sum_{r=1}^{n} r$ represent?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '$\\sum_{r=1}^{n} r = 1 + 2 + 3 + \\dots + n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(541, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the magnitude of the vector sum $\\mathbf{a} + \\mathbf{b}$ if $\\mathbf{a} = 3\\mathbf{i} + 4\\mathbf{j}$ and $\\mathbf{b} = 1\\mathbf{i} - 1\\mathbf{j}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Vector sum is $(3+1)\\mathbf{i} + (4-1)\\mathbf{j} = 4\\mathbf{i} + 3\\mathbf{j}$. Magnitude is $\\sqrt{4^2 + 3^2} = \\sqrt{25} = 5$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(542, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-32', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which conic section has an eccentricity equal to 1?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'By definition, a parabola is the locus of points equidistant from a focus and directrix, corresponding to an eccentricity $e = 1$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(543, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-33', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the value of $\\cos(0)$?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The cosine of 0 radians (or 0 degrees) on the unit circle is equal to 1.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(544, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-34', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the stationary points of the function $f(x) = x^3 - 3x$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Setting $f\'(x) = 3x^2 - 3 = 0$ gives $x^2 = 1$, so stationary points occur at $x = 1$ and $x = -1$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(545, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-35', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the product of the roots of the quadratic equation $3x^2 + 7x - 4 = 0$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The product of roots for $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ is $c/a$. Here, $-4/3$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(546, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-36', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the angle between two perpendicular vectors?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Perpendicular (orthogonal) vectors intersect at a right angle, which is $90^\\circ$ (or $\\pi/2$ radians).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(547, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-37', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the general solution to the homogeneous second-order ODE $y\'\' - 4y = 0$?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Auxiliary equation $m^2 - 4 = 0 \\implies m = \\pm 2$. Solution is $y = Ae^{2x} + Be^{-2x}$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(548, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-38', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Evaluate $\\int \\frac{1}{x} dx$.', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The standard integral of $1/x$ with respect to $x$ is the natural logarithm $\\ln|x| + C$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(549, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-39', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the rank of a zero matrix?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The rank of a zero matrix (where all elements are 0) is defined as 0.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:15', '2026-09-16 00:14:15', NULL),
(550, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-40', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does Mathematical Induction primarily prove?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Mathematical induction is a proof technique used to establish that a statement holds for all natural numbers $n \\ge 1$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(551, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-41', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Find the slope of the normal line to the curve $y = x^2$ at the point $(2, 4)$.', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Gradient of tangent is $dy/dx = 2x = 4$. Slope of normal is negative reciprocal: $-1/4$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(552, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-42', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the sum of the first $n$ terms of an Arithmetic Progression with first term $a$ and last term $l$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The formula for the sum of an AP given first and last terms is $S_n = \\frac{n}{2}(a + l)$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(553, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the value of $i^4$ where $i = \\sqrt{-1}$?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Since $i^2 = -1$, then $i^4 = (i^2)^2 = (-1)^2 = 1$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(554, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-44', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the directional derivative of a scalar field maximized along?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'A scalar field increases most rapidly in the direction of its gradient vector.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(555, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-45', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Find the volume of revolution when the region under $y = \\sqrt{x}$ from $x = 0$ to $x = 4$ is rotated about the x-axis.', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Volume $V = \\pi \\int y^2 dx = \\pi \\int_{0}^{4} x dx = \\pi \\left[ \\frac{x^2}{2} \\right]_0^4 = \\pi (8) = 8\\pi$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(556, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-46', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the identity matrix of order 3 denoted as?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'An identity matrix of dimension $n \\times n$ is denoted by $I_n$, so order 3 is $I_3$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(557, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-47', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the expansion of $\\sin(A + B)$ in trigonometric identities?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The angle addition formula for sine is $\\sin(A+B) = \\sin A \\cos B + \\cos A \\sin B$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(558, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-48', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the degree of the differential equation $\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)^3 + 2y \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = 5$', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The degree of a differential equation is the highest exponent of the highest-order derivative. The highest-order derivative is $d^2y/dx^2$ (order 2), and its power is 1.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(559, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-49', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the polar form of the complex number $z = 1 + i$', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Modulus is $\\sqrt{2}$ and argument is $\\pi/4$, so polar form is $r(\\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta) = \\sqrt{2}(\\cos(\\pi/4) + i\\sin(\\pi/4))$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(560, 5, 10, NULL, 'FM-50', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the sum of the first $n$ natural numbers cubed $\\sum_{r=1}^{n} r^3$?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The sum of the first $n$ cubes equals the square of the sum of the first $n$ natural numbers: $\\left[\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\\right]^2$.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:14:16', '2026-09-16 00:14:16', NULL),
(561, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of \'Good morning / Good day\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Bonjour\' is the standard French greeting used for \'Good morning\' or \'Good day\' until evening.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(562, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-02', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which subject pronoun corresponds to the formal \'you\' (singular) or plural \'you\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Vous\' is used for formal address to a single person or to address multiple people (plural you).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(563, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct conjugation of the verb *être* (to be) for the pronoun *je* (I)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'In the present tense, \'je\' pairs with \'suis\' (*je suis* = I am).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(564, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-04', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which article is the feminine singular definite article in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'La\' is the feminine singular definite article (\'the\'), whereas \'le\' is masculine and \'les\' is plural.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(565, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-05', 'mcq', 'easy', 'How do you say \'Thank you very much\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Merci beaucoup\' translates directly to \'Thank you very much\' or \'Thanks a lot\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(566, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-06', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the correct plural form of the noun *le livre* (the book)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'To make a noun plural in French, the article changes to \'les\' and an \'s\' is typically added to the noun (*les livres*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(567, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-07', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which verb auxiliary is used to form the *passé composé* (past tense) of verbs of movement like *aller* (to go)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Verbs of motion and reflexive verbs (DR and MRS VANDERTRAMP) form their *passé composé* with *être* rather than *avoir*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(568, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-08', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the English meaning of the French phrase *\'Il fait beau\'*?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, '\'Il fait beau\' is an idiomatic weather expression meaning \'The weather is fine / nice / sunny\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(569, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-09', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is an *-ir* verb belonging to the second regular conjugation group?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, '*Finir* is a regular second-group *-ir* verb (participle *fini*, present *finissons*). *Aller* is irregular.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(570, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-10', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the correct negative structure in French for \'I do not like\' (*aimer*)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Before a vowel or mute \'h\', *ne* elides to *n\'*, resulting in *Je n\'aime pas*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(571, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-11', 'mcq', 'easy', 'How do you write the number \'fifty\' (50) in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The number 50 in French is *cinquante*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(572, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-12', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the feminine form of the adjective *grand* (tall/big)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'To make regular adjectives feminine in French, an \'e\' is added to the masculine singular form (*grande*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(573, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-13', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which preposition is correctly used before feminine countries like *la France* to mean \'in/to France\'?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Feminine countries take the preposition *en* (*en France*, *en Italie*), while masculine countries take *au*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(574, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-14', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct conjugation of *avoir* (to have) for *nous* (we)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The present tense conjugation of *avoir* for *nous* is *avons* (*nous avons* = we have).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(575, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-15', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which pronoun replaces a direct object noun representing a plural feminine group (*les pommes*)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The direct object pronoun for plural nouns (both masculine and feminine) is *les*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(576, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-16', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the phrase *\'S\'il vous plaît\'* mean in English?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'S\'il vous plaît\' translates to \'Please\' when addressing someone formally or in plural (*s\'il te plaît* informally).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(577, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-17', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What tense is used to describe ongoing past actions, background settings, or habits in French?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, '*L\'imparfait* (imperfect tense) is used for continuous, habitual, or descriptive background actions in the past.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(578, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-18', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of the following colors agrees in gender and is invariable in French (remains the same in masculine and feminine)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Color adjectives derived from fruit or objects like *orange* and *marron* are invariable in French.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(579, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-19', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of \'My name is...\' using the reflexive verb *s\'appeler*?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Je m\'appelle\' literally translates to \'I call myself...\' and is the standard way to state one\'s name in French.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(580, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-20', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the correct partitive article used before an uncountable masculine noun like *eau* (water - elided)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Before a vowel sound, *de la* or *du* elides to *de l\'* (*de l\'eau*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:22', '2026-09-16 00:15:22', NULL),
(581, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-21', 'mcq', 'easy', 'How do you ask \'How much is it?\' or \'How much does it cost?\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Combien ça coûte?\' is the standard phrase used to ask for the price of an item.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(582, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which auxiliary verb is used to conjugate regular *-er* verbs in the *passé composé*?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Almost all regular *-er* verbs use *avoir* as the auxiliary verb in compound past tenses.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(583, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-23', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the correct plural form of the demonstrative adjective *ce* before a masculine noun starting with a vowel (*homme*)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The plural form of demonstrative adjectives (*ce/cet/cette*) for all genders is *ces* (*ces hommes*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(584, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-24', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of these words is a false friend (faux ami) where *actuellement* means \'currently\' rather than \'actually\'?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, '*Actuellement* in French means \'currently\' or \'at present\', whereas \'actually\' translates to *en fait* or *réellement*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(585, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-25', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of \'tomorrow\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Demain\' means tomorrow, \'hier\' means yesterday, and \'aujourd\'hui\' means today.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(586, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-26', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which pronoun is used to address a close friend or family member informally as \'you\'?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Tu\' is the singular informal pronoun used for friends, children, and pets.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(587, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-27', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the past participle of the irregular verb *faire* (to do/make)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The past participle of *faire* is *fait*, used in compound tenses (*j\'ai fait*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(588, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-28', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which preposition is used to indicate origin or \'from\' a city like Paris (*de Paris*)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Cities typically take *à* (to/in) and *de* (from), e.g., *venir de Paris*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(589, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-29', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the English translation of the idiom *\'Avoir faim\'*?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'French uses the verb *avoir* (to have) for physical states, so *avoir faim* means \'to be hungry\' (literally \'to have hunger\').', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(590, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-30', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which form of the interrogative adjective *quel* is correct for a feminine plural noun (*les questions*)?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'For feminine plural nouns, the interrogative adjective is *quelles* (pronounced identically to singular forms).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(591, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-31', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the correct conjugation of the irregular verb *aller* (to go) for *nous* (we)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The present tense of *aller* for *nous* is *allons* (*nous allons* = we are going / we go).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(592, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-32', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which negative expression means \'never\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, '*Ne... jamais* translates to \'never\', whereas *ne... plus* means \'no longer\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(593, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-33', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the superlative form of \'good\' (*bon*) in French?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The comparative of *bon* is *meilleur* (better) and the superlative is *le/la/les meilleur(e)(s)* (the best).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(594, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-34', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of \'The pen is on the table\'?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '*Sur* means \'on\' or \'upon\', whereas *sous* means under, *dans* means in.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(595, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-35', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which relative pronoun is used to represent the subject of a clause (\'who / which / that\')?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, '*Qui* acts as the subject relative pronoun (followed by a verb), while *que* is the direct object.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(596, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-36', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What is the correct spelling of the number \'ninety-one\' in standard French?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'In standard French (France), 91 is expressed as *quatre-vingt-onze* (4 × 20 + 11).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(597, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-37', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What mood is used in French to express doubt, wishes, necessity, or emotion after *que*?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The subjunctive (*le subjonctif*) is triggered in subordinate clauses expressing subjective uncertainty, necessity, or emotion.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(598, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-38', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following verbs is a modal/semi-auxiliary verb meaning \'can / to be able to\'?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, '*Pouvoir* means \'can / to be able to\', *vouloir* means \'to want\', and *devoir* means \'must / to have to\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(599, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-39', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of \'I would like a coffee, please\'?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '*Je voudrais* (conditional of *vouloir*) is the polite and standard way to request something in French restaurants.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(600, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-40', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What tense is formed by using the auxiliary verb in the conditional tense followed by a past participle?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The past conditional (*le conditionnel passé*) expresses actions that would have happened, formed with conditional auxiliary + past participle.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_questions` (`id`, `organization_id`, `subject_id`, `topic_id`, `question_code`, `question_type`, `difficulty_level`, `question`, `question_image`, `question_image_alt`, `marks`, `negative_marks`, `explanation`, `hint`, `time_limit_seconds`, `is_randomizable`, `status`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`) VALUES
(601, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-41', 'mcq', 'easy', 'How do you say \'Merry Christmas\' in French?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Joyeux Noël\' is the traditional greeting for Merry Christmas in France.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(602, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-42', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which preposition is used before masculine names of cities or specific locations like *Le Havre*?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'When a city name includes a masculine article like *Le Havre*, the preposition contracts: *à + le* becomes *au Havre*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(603, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-43', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the feminine plural form of the adjective *beau* (handsome/beautiful)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The irregular adjective *beau* has forms: masculine singular *beau/bel*, masculine plural *beaux*, feminine singular *belle*, feminine plural *belles*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(604, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-44', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which pronoun is used to replace places, or nouns introduced by *de* indicating quantity or origin?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'The pronoun *en* replaces expressions of quantity or prepositional phrases starting with *de*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(605, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-45', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the correct translation of \'We are going to study\' using the *futur proche* (near future)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The near future (*futur proche*) is constructed using conjugated *aller* + infinitive verb (*allons étudier*).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(606, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-46', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following is a reflexive pronoun for the third-person singular/plural (*he/she/theymselves*)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The reflexive pronoun for *il/elle/ils/elles* is *se* (which elides to *s\'* before a vowel).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(607, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-47', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the past participle of the irregular verb *prendre* (to take)?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The past participle of *prendre* and its derivatives (*comprendre*, *apprendre*) is *pris*.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(608, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-48', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What does the expression *\'Il y a\'* mean in English?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'Il y a\' is a vital fixed expression meaning \'there is\' or \'there are\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(609, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-49', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which auxiliary verb is used to form the passive voice (*la voix passive*) in French?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Passive voice in French is constructed using *être* conjugated in the required tense followed by the past participle of the main verb.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(610, 5, 18, NULL, 'FR-50', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the correct translation of the farewell expression *\'À bientôt\'*?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, '\'À bientôt\' translates literally to \'Until soon\' or \'See you soon\'.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:15:23', '2026-09-16 00:15:23', NULL),
(611, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-01', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the imaginary line of latitude located at 0 degrees called?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Equator is the 0° line of latitude dividing the Earth into the Northern and Southern Hemispheres.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(612, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-02', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which layer of the Earth\'s atmosphere contains the ozone layer that absorbs harmful UV radiation?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The stratosphere houses the ozone layer, which protects life on Earth by filtering out ultraviolet solar radiation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(613, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-03', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of rock is formed from the cooling and solidification of molten magma or lava?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Igneous rocks form when magma or lava cools and crystallizes (e.g., basalt, granite).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(614, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-04', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which of the following ocean currents is a warm current influencing the climate of Western Europe?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The Gulf Stream is a powerful warm ocean current originating in the Gulf of Mexico that moderates European climates.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(615, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-05', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes the process of wearing away and transporting soil and rock by natural agents like water, wind, or ice?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Erosion is the geological process where earthen materials are worn away and transported by natural forces.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(616, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-06', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which tectonic plate boundary involves two plates moving apart from each other?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Divergent boundaries occur where tectonic plates pull apart, creating rift valleys and mid-ocean ridges.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(617, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-07', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the name of the supercontinent that existed during the late Paleozoic and early Mesozoic eras before breaking apart?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Pangaea was the supercontinent proposed by Alfred Wegener that eventually split into northern and southern landmasses.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(618, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-08', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which instrument is used to measure atmospheric pressure?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A barometer measures atmospheric air pressure, aiding meteorologists in forecasting weather changes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(619, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-09', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What biomes are characterized by low temperatures, short growing seasons, and a permanently frozen subsurface layer called permafrost?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The tundra biome features harsh cold climates, treeless landscapes, and frozen subsoil (permafrost).', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(620, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-10', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which river is recognized as the longest river in the world?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The Nile River in Africa is traditionally measured as the world\'s longest river flowing northward into the Mediterranean.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(621, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-11', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the point on the Earth\'s surface directly above the focus of an earthquake called?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The epicenter is the geographical point on Earth\'s surface directly above the underground earthquake hypocenter.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(622, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-12', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which atmospheric phenomenon involves moisture condensing on surfaces near the ground when temperatures drop below the dew point?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Dew forms when atmospheric water vapor condenses into liquid droplets on cool surfaces overnight.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(623, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-13', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What type of rainfall occurs when warm, moist air is forced to rise over mountain barriers, cooling and condensing?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Orographic rainfall occurs when moist air ascends windward slopes of mountains, producing heavy precipitation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(624, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-14', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which desert is the largest hot desert in the world?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Sahara Desert spans across North Africa, covering approximately 9.2 million square kilometers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(625, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-15', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes the angular distance of a place north or south of the Earth\'s equator measured in degrees?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Latitude measures angular distance north or south of the equator ranging from 0° to 90°.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(626, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-16', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which layer of the Earth is located directly beneath the crust and consists of semi-molten silicate rock?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'The mantle lies between the crust and core, exhibiting plastic convection currents that drive plate tectonics.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(627, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-17', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What is the primary cause of ocean tides on Earth?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Ocean tides are generated primarily by the gravitational attraction exerted by the Moon and Sun on Earth\'s oceans.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(628, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-18', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which scale is used to quantify the magnitude of earthquakes based on energy released?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Richter scale (and modern Moment Magnitude scale) measures the total energy released by seismic events.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(629, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-19', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What type of cloud is fluffy, white, and typically associated with fair weather?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Cumulus clouds are detached, white, fluffy cotton-like clouds usually indicating sunny, pleasant weather.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(630, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-20', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which country has the largest land area in the world?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Russia is the largest country globally by total land area, spanning across Eastern Europe and Northern Asia.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(631, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-21', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term refers to the movement of people from rural areas to urban centers?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Urbanization represents the demographic shift and population concentration from rural countryside into cities.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(632, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-22', 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which wind belt blows consistently from the subtropical high-pressure zones toward the equator?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'Trade winds are steady easterly surface winds blowing towards the equatorial trough in both hemispheres.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(633, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-23', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the flat, triangular depositional landform created at the mouth of a river as it enters a standing body of water called?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'A river delta forms when sediment carried by a river is deposited as the current slows down entering a sea or lake.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(634, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-24', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which ocean is the largest and deepest on Earth?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Pacific Ocean is the largest and deepest of Earth\'s oceanic divisions, containing the Mariana Trench.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(635, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-25', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the name of the imaginary line of longitude running through Greenwich, London, set at 0 degrees?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The Prime Meridian is the international zero-point reference line for longitude and time zones.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(636, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-26', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which type of volcano is broad, dome-shaped with gently sloping sides formed by low-viscosity lava flows?', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 0.00, 'Shield volcanoes like Mauna Loa feature broad, gently sloping cones built by successive runny basaltic lava flows.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(637, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-27', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What term describes the average weather conditions of a region recorded over a long period (typically 30 years or more)?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Climate represents long-term atmospheric statistics, whereas weather describes short-term daily conditions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(638, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-28', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which African country is the most populous nation on the continent?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Nigeria is Africa\'s most populous country, with over 200 million residents and rapid urban growth.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(639, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-29', 'mcq', 'medium', 'What geological feature is formed when a meandering river loop is cut off from the main channel?', NULL, NULL, 1.50, 0.00, 'An oxbow lake forms as erosion and deposition narrow the neck of a river meander until the loop is abandoned.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(640, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-30', 'mcq', 'easy', 'Which layer of the atmosphere is closest to the Earth\'s surface and where all weather phenomena occur?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'The troposphere is the lowest atmospheric layer containing roughly 75% of atmospheric mass and weather dynamics.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
(641, 5, 16, NULL, 'GEO-31', 'mcq', 'easy', 'What is the term for a map maker or the study of map-making practice?', NULL, NULL, 1.00, 0.00, 'Cartography is the science and art of designing, compiling, and producing geographical maps.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 2, NULL, '2026-09-16 00:16:33', '2026-09-16 00:16:33', NULL),
