(1972, 9, 31, NULL, NULL, 'mcq', 'medium', 'A patient with pneumonia develops pleuritic chest pain. What does pleuritic pain typically worsen with?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Inflamed pleural surfaces cause sharp pain that is typically aggravated by deep inspiration and coughing.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-06 12:44:14', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
