(1987, 9, 31, NULL, NULL, 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which condition involves accumulation of fluid in the pleural space?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Pleural effusion is an abnormal collection of fluid between the pleural layers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-06 12:44:14', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
