(2001, 9, 31, NULL, NULL, 'mcq', 'medium', 'Which oxygen-delivery device can provide a precise concentration of oxygen?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'A Venturi mask delivers a controlled and relatively precise fraction of inspired oxygen.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-06 12:44:14', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
