(2207, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-180', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Generalised anxiety disorder is characterised by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'GAD is characterised by persistent, excessive, and difficult-to-control worry.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2208, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-181', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A patient with HIV/TB co-infection requires treatment for both conditions. Rifampicin interacts with many ARVs by inducing which enzyme?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Rifampicin strongly induces CYP3A4, increasing metabolism and reducing levels of many antiretroviral drugs.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2209, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-182', 'mcq', 'hard', 'What type of immunity is conferred by vaccination?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Vaccination stimulates the person\'s own immune system, producing artificial active immunity.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2210, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-183', 'mcq', 'hard', 'How many pairs of spinal nerves are found in humans?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Humans have 31 pairs of spinal nerves: 8 cervical, 12 thoracic, 5 lumbar, 5 sacral, and 1 coccygeal.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2211, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-184', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The hormone prolactin, which increases significantly during pregnancy, has what primary role.', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Prolactin promotes breast development and prepares the mammary glands for milk production.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2212, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-185', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which nursing diagnosis is priority for patient with severe burns in first 24 hours?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Major burns cause massive fluid shifts and losses, making fluid volume deficit an immediate priority.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2213, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-186', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The process of involving people and giving them responsibility in a PHC programme is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Community participation involves people actively taking part in planning, implementing, and evaluating health programmes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2214, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-187', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client asks why their spleen might be enlarged during typhoid fever. The nurse explains it is due to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Typhoid infection stimulates the reticuloendothelial system, including macrophage proliferation, contributing to splenomegaly.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2215, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-188', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client with a subdural haematoma is typically characterized by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'A subdural haematoma usually results from venous bleeding and may develop gradually as blood accumulates.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2216, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-189', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Compared with a manager, an entrepreneur is mainly characterised by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'An entrepreneur identifies opportunities and creates new ventures, often accepting calculated risks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
(2217, 9, 34, NULL, 'QU-DEV-190', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Exchange of oxygen and nutrients between mother and fetus takes place in the', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The placenta is the primary site for exchange of oxygen, nutrients, and wastes between mother and fetus.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:10:39', '2026-10-10 11:40:55', '2026-10-10 11:40:55'),
