(3446, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-186', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The process of involving people and giving them responsibility in a PHC programme is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Community participation involves people actively taking part in planning, implementing, and evaluating health programmes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3447, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-187', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client asks why their spleen might be enlarged during typhoid fever. The nurse explains it is due to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Typhoid infection stimulates the reticuloendothelial system, including macrophage proliferation, contributing to splenomegaly.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3448, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-188', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client with a subdural haematoma is typically characterized by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'A subdural haematoma usually results from venous bleeding and may develop gradually as blood accumulates.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3449, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-189', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Compared with a manager, an entrepreneur is mainly characterised by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'An entrepreneur identifies opportunities and creates new ventures, often accepting calculated risks.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3450, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-190', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Exchange of oxygen and nutrients between mother and fetus takes place in the', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The placenta is the primary site for exchange of oxygen, nutrients, and wastes between mother and fetus.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3451, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-191', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The highest risk of TB transmission to family occurs through', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Pulmonary TB spreads mainly through airborne droplets, especially in poorly ventilated spaces.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3452, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-192', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of these is a main muscle involved in respiration?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The diaphragm is the primary muscle responsible for normal inspiration.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3453, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-193', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Among these IV fluids, the isotonic crystalloid is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Lactated Ringer solution is an isotonic crystalloid commonly used for fluid replacement.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3454, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-194', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The successful transition through the fourth stage is best indicated by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'A firm uterus and stable vital signs indicate effective recovery and absence of immediate postpartum complications.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3455, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-195', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of the following instruments can be used to visualize the retina when assessing a patient eye?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'An ophthalmoscope is used to examine the retina and other internal structures of the eye.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3456, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-196', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The feature that distinguishes periodontitis from gingivitis is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Periodontitis involves destruction of supporting tissues, including alveolar bone, whereas gingivitis does not.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3457, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-197', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of the following is an environmental stressor?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Extreme cold is an environmental or physical stressor originating from the external environment.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3458, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-198', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Pain is best described as', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Pain is a subjective sensory and emotional experience that varies between individuals.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3459, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-199', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which is the most common cause of polyhydramnios?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'In many cases, no specific cause is identified, making idiopathic polyhydramnios the most common category.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3460, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-200', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The equipment and programs used to process raw data into information are called', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Information technology includes the hardware and software used to process, store, and communicate information.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3461, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-201', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Before the eruption of the wisdom teeth, an adult has how many teeth', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Adults normally have 32 permanent teeth when third molars are included; without wisdom teeth, there are 28.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3462, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-202', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A FHR pattern showing a gradual decrease that mirrors the contraction is identified as an early deceleration, which is caused by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Early decelerations are caused by fetal head compression during uterine contractions.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3463, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-203', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which of the following classes of drugs produces the same effect on the pupil as a bright light?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Bright light causes pupillary constriction, and miotics produce pupil constriction.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3464, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-204', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The reproductive health package that addresses maternal, newborn, and family planning services in emergencies is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The Minimum Initial Service Package (MISP) provides essential reproductive health services during emergencies.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3465, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-205', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client with maxillary sinusitis will complain of pain:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The maxillary sinuses are located in the cheek area, so inflammation commonly causes cheek or facial pain.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3466, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-206', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which is a barrier to communication?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Medical jargon can be difficult for patients to understand and can interfere with effective communication.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3467, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-207', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The primary role of surfactant in the lungs is to:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Pulmonary surfactant reduces alveolar surface tension and prevents alveolar collapse.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3468, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-208', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A clay-coloured stool is an indication of:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Clay-coloured stool results from reduced bile reaching the intestine, commonly due to biliary obstruction.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3469, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-209', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A patient with MRSA infection requires antibiotic therapy. Which antibiotic is the drug of choice for MRSA?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Vancomycin is a standard treatment for serious MRSA infections, depending on infection site and susceptibility.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3470, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-210', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A woman at 28 weeks presents with a sudden gush of clear fluid without contractions. The most likely diagnosis is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'PPROM is rupture of membranes before 37 weeks and before the onset of labour.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3471, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-211', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which is a sign of hypoglycemia?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Hypoglycemia commonly causes autonomic symptoms such as sweating and tremor, along with confusion or altered consciousness.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3472, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-212', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Blood group antigens are found mainly on the surface of', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'ABO and Rh blood group antigens are primarily located on red blood cell membranes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3473, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-213', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A child with pertussis (whooping cough) is in the paroxysmal stage. The priority nursing intervention during a coughing spell is to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Positioning the child upright and monitoring the airway helps maintain ventilation and reduces the risk of airway compromise.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3474, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-214', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The application of economic theory and concepts in health care is called...', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Health economics applies economic principles to the production, distribution, and use of health services.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3475, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-215', 'mcq', 'hard', '??.. is gradual in onset and last a relatively long time', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Chronic illness typically develops gradually and persists for a prolonged period.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3476, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-216', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The process of sperm cell formation in the testes is called', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Spermatogenesis is the process by which sperm cells develop in the seminiferous tubules of the testes.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3477, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-217', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Part of the management of an exceptional child is that the child should', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Education should be adapted to the child\'s abilities and needs to support optimal development and inclusion.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3478, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-218', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Episiotomy during a normal vaginal delivery should be performed', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Episiotomy is not routinely recommended; it should be performed only when clinically indicated.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3479, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-219', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Both erythrocytes and leucocytes are formed in:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Bone marrow is the major site of production of red blood cells and most white blood cells.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3480, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-220', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea in heart failure is mainly due to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'When supine, fluid redistributes from the lower body to the lungs, increasing pulmonary congestion.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3481, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-221', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The average length of the adult spinal cord is approximately', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The adult spinal cord is approximately 45 cm long and extends from the medulla to about L1?L2.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3482, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-222', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A disease moves from epidemic to endemic status when its occurrence', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'An endemic disease maintains a relatively constant or expected level of occurrence in a population or area.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3483, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-223', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Apraxia witnessed in Cerebrovascular Accident patients is simply', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Apraxia is the inability to perform purposeful learned movements despite adequate strength and coordination.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3484, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-224', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which lymphocyte serves as primary HIV replication target?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'HIV primarily infects CD4 T-helper lymphocytes through their CD4 receptors and coreceptors.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3485, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-225', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A nurse is administering the pentavalent vaccine. The nurse knows this vaccine provides protection against diphtheria, pertussis, tetanus, Hepatitis B, and', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The pentavalent vaccine protects against DPT, hepatitis B, and Haemophilus influenzae type b.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3486, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-226', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The following are early warning signs of mental illness EXCEPT', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Healthy connection and socialization are not typically considered an early warning sign of mental illness.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3487, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-227', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The main function of the cornea is to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The cornea provides most of the eye\'s refractive power, helping focus light toward the retina.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3488, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-228', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A woman with placenta praevia goes into labour with heavy bleeding. Immediate management is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Heavy bleeding with placenta praevia during labour generally requires urgent delivery, usually by Caesarean section.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3489, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-229', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which technique is most therapeutic when a patient describes distressing feelings?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Active listening allows the patient to express feelings and helps the nurse provide therapeutic support.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3490, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-230', 'mcq', 'hard', 'When evaluating the effectiveness of a pain management plan, the most appropriate data to collect is the', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The patient\'s self-reported pain level is the most direct and reliable measure of pain intensity.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3491, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-231', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A woman with an episiotomy has increasing perineal pain, swelling and a tense bluish lump. The nurse should suspect', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'A perineal haematoma causes increasing pain, swelling, and a tense or bluish mass due to accumulated blood.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3492, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-232', 'mcq', 'hard', 'When inserting an indwelling urinary catheter in a female, the nurse must use', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Indwelling urinary catheterization requires sterile technique to reduce the risk of introducing infection.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3493, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-233', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A toddler with a rapidly rising fever becomes irritable. Which finding needs urgent attention?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Jerking limbs may indicate a febrile seizure, which requires immediate assessment and intervention.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3494, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-234', 'mcq', 'hard', 'All the following are components of the CNS EXCEPT?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Spinal nerves are part of the peripheral nervous system, while the brain and spinal cord form the CNS.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3495, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-235', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The brain of the computer is also known as:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The central processing unit (CPU) is commonly referred to as the brain of the computer.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3496, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-236', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Majority of breast cancer occur in the', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'The upper outer quadrant contains the largest amount of breast tissue and accounts for the greatest proportion of breast cancers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3497, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-237', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which measure is most effective in preventing skin breakdown in a bedridden older adult?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Frequent repositioning relieves prolonged pressure over bony prominences and helps prevent pressure injuries.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3498, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-238', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A patient presents with an irregularly pigmented skin lesion. Which skin cancer is most aggressive with highest metastatic potential?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Malignant melanoma is highly aggressive and has a greater tendency to metastasize than most common skin cancers.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3499, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-239', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A fetal complication of gestational diabetes is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Excess maternal glucose can cause fetal hyperinsulinaemia and excessive fetal growth, resulting in macrosomia.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3500, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-240', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A community health committee mainly serves to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Community health committees provide a channel for community participation and representation of local health needs.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3501, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-241', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A client has a deep partial-thickness burn. The nurse would expect the wound to', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Deep partial-thickness burns involve deeper dermal tissue and may appear mottled red-white with sluggish capillary refill.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3502, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-242', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Mild to moderate perinatal psychiatric disorders are:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Mild to moderate perinatal disorders commonly include anxiety-related disorders such as phobias, panic disorder, and OCD.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_questions` (`id`, `organization_id`, `subject_id`, `topic_id`, `question_code`, `question_type`, `difficulty_level`, `question`, `question_image`, `question_image_alt`, `marks`, `negative_marks`, `explanation`, `hint`, `time_limit_seconds`, `is_randomizable`, `status`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`) VALUES
(3503, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-243', 'mcq', 'hard', 'When communicating with the family of a dying patient, the nurse should use', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Simple, clear language promotes understanding and supports effective communication during a sensitive situation.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3504, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-244', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which virus is a major risk factor in the causation of cervical cancer?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Persistent infection with high-risk human papillomavirus, particularly HPV 16 and 18, is the major cause of cervical cancer.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3505, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-245', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Bisphosphonates such as alendronate act mainly by', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Bisphosphonates reduce bone resorption primarily by inhibiting osteoclast activity.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3506, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-246', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Heparin exerts its anticoagulant effect mainly by activating', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Heparin enhances antithrombin III activity, which inhibits thrombin and factor Xa.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3507, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-247', 'mcq', 'hard', 'A characteristic feature of Charcot foot is', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Charcot neuroarthropathy causes progressive joint destruction and deformity, often with little or no pain because of neuropathy.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3508, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-248', 'mcq', 'hard', 'The process of releasing a mature ovum from a ruptured ovarian follicle is called what.', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Ovulation is the release of a mature ovum from a ruptured ovarian follicle.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3509, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-249', 'mcq', 'hard', 'At PHC level, vaccines are stored in:', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'An ice-lined refrigerator maintains the required vaccine storage temperature at primary health-care facilities.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3510, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-250', 'mcq', 'hard', 'An entrepreneur conducting PESTLE analysis examines all of the following factors EXCEPT', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'PESTLE covers Political, Economic, Social, Technological, Legal, and Environmental factors; competitive rivalry belongs to industry/competitive analysis.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
(3511, 9, 30, NULL, 'AD-DEV-251', 'mcq', 'hard', 'Which vitamin is essential for normal blood clotting?', NULL, NULL, 0.40, 0.00, 'Vitamin K is required for synthesis of several clotting factors in the liver.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'active', 7, NULL, '2026-10-10 15:07:45', '2026-10-10 15:07:45', NULL),
